Error [jet.StrayCharacter]: `\u{D800}` is a surrogate, not a Unicode scalar
  --> tests/ui/scalar_escape_out_of_range.jet:2:13
    |
  2 |     print("a\u{D800}b\u{110000}c")
    |             ^^^^^^^^
 Why: `\u{H}` names one Unicode scalar by one to six hexadecimal digits, up to 10FFFF and not a surrogate (D800-DFFF)
 Fix: Write the scalar's hexadecimal value in braces, for example `\u{e9}`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0001

Error [jet.StrayCharacter]: `\u{110000}` is past 10FFFF, the last Unicode scalar
  --> tests/ui/scalar_escape_out_of_range.jet:2:22
    |
  2 |     print("a\u{D800}b\u{110000}c")
    |                      ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `\u{H}` names one Unicode scalar by one to six hexadecimal digits, up to 10FFFF and not a surrogate (D800-DFFF)
 Fix: Write the scalar's hexadecimal value in braces, for example `\u{e9}`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0001
